Subject: [PATCH 3/4] ci: AMWA BCP-007-03-01 against Strom's NMOS node

scripts/nmos-amwa/run.sh starts an nmos-cpp registry (mirror.gcr.io)
and Strom headless with one MXL video output and one MXL audio input,
runs nmos-testing 9001851 from source, and fails on any result not
listed in expected.json.
